'''EG-86''' was a [[Gender|masculine]] [[EG-series power droid]] that served the rebellion as a [[Courier droid|courier]] of vital information. Rebel [[Hera Syndulla]] dispatched fellow rebels [[Sabine Wren]], [[Ezra Bridger]], and the [[droid]] [[C1-10P]] to find EG-86 and take it to the [[Havoc Outpost]], but their mission was nearly compromised by the [[bounty hunter]] [[Ketsu Onyo]], who tried to gather the droid for the criminal organization called [[Black Sun]]. Onyo had a change of heart, though, and helped the rebels deliver EG-86 to the Havoc Outpost.<ref name="Blood Sisters" />

{{Droid-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
EG-86 first appeared in "[[Blood Sisters]]," the eighth episode of [[Star Wars Rebels Season Two|season two]] of the ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]'' television series.<ref name="Blood Sisters" />

